{title: 550 - Every Flower That Grows}
{subtitle: SDA Hymnal #550 • }
{lyricist: }
{composer: }
{key: D}
{time: 4/4}
{tempo: Moderato}
{meta: hymn_number 550}
{meta: category Christian Life - }

{start_of_verse: Verse 1}
[D]Every flow’r that [Bm]grows, [G]Every [D]brook [Bm]that [F#m]flows,
Tell of [Bm7]beauty [F#m]God has [Dmaj7]giv’n [E7]for [F#m]me:
[F#m7]Through[Bm]out [F#m]my[Gmaj7]life[A]may [Bm]beau[A]ty [D]be
[Em]Deep with[D]in [Em]a[D]heart [A7]from [Bm]sin [Em7]set [D]fr[Em7]ee.[D]
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 2}
[D]Gracious [Bm]Lord [G]above, [D]Looking [Bm]down [F#m]in love,
[Bm7]Guide my [F#m]thoughts, my [Dmaj7]life, in [E7]my walk [F#m]with Thee,
[F#m7]That [Bm]day [F#m]by [Gmaj7]day [A]the [Bm]world [A]may [D]see
[Em][D]Christ, [Em]the [D]Lord [A7]and [Bm][Em7]Savior, [D]lives [Em7]in [D]me.
{end_of_verse}

{start_of_verse: Verse 3}
[D]All [Bm]my earthly [G]days, [D]I shall [Bm]sing [F#m]and praise
[Bm7]God [F#m]the Father, [Dmaj7]Spirit, and [E7]Christ with [F#m]the Son.
[F#m7]Grant [Bm]faith [F#m]when [Gmaj7]life [A]on [Bm]earth [A]is [D]done,
[Em][D]I [Em]shall [D]sing [A7]with [Bm]those [Em7]whose [D]rest [Em7]is [D]won.
{end_of_verse}
